OL,3,GNEWSA'We can move on with our lives' as
OL,4,Aillegal tip clearance begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FA resident living next to a large
OL,7,Fillegal waste tip that led to rat
OL,8,Finfestations and a fire says her family
OL,9,Fcan "finally move on with our lives"
OL,10,Fafter work to clear the site began.
OL,12,FAbout 18,000 tonnes of waste began to
OL,13,Fbe moved from Bolton House Road, near
OL,14,FBickershaw, Wigan, on Tuesday. The
OL,15,Fgovernment-funded operation will see up
OL,16,Fto 25 lorry loads of waste removed a
OL,17,Fday and is expected to take until
OL,18,FSpring.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
