OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'We can move on with our lives' as
OL,4,Aillegal tip clearance begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigner and resident Nicha Rowson
OL,7,Fsaid she was "absolutely ecstatic" but
OL,8,Fthe community should not have had the
OL,9,Fsmells or "this monstrosity on our
OL,10,Fdoorstep" for two years.
OL,12,FWigan Council leader Nazia Rehman
OL,13,Fthanked "everyone who has campaigned
OL,14,Ftirelessly to get us to this point".
